WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Hi, Jason,
welcome to FD inroads,

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.000
an interactive program that sharpens
your situational awareness skills

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.513
to help keep you safe
behind the wheel.

4
00:00:08.245 --> 00:00:10.827
Situational awareness
comes down to three things:

5
00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:12.434
seeing what's around you,

6
00:00:12.718 --> 00:00:14.177
understanding what it means,

7
00:00:14.575 --> 00:00:16.415
and knowing what's about to happen next,

8
00:00:16.688 --> 00:00:17.712
all in the moment,

9
00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:18.971
all at once.

10
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.386
So, each session puts you
through three short Challenges,

11
00:00:24.003 --> 00:00:26.664
back-to-back: an Observe
Challenge, a Process Challenge,

12
00:00:26.947 --> 00:00:28.546
and an Anticipate Challenge.

13
00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:33.066
Each one shows you a real driving
scenario and asks what you'd do:

14
00:00:33.477 --> 00:00:34.213
no warm-up, no hints.

15
00:00:34.477 --> 00:00:35.351
That's the point:

16
00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:39.377
we want to see how you'd
actually handle it. Do well,

17
00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:41.894
and you'll move through quickly.

18
00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:43.667
If something trips you up,

19
00:00:44.006 --> 00:00:45.922
we'll walk you through it, so it sticks.

20
00:00:46.553 --> 00:00:51.127
This only takes a few minutes, and you'll
only see each scene once, so stay alert.

21
00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:52.750
Let's get started.
